jcajce/provider/BouncyCastleFipsProvider.html\\norg/bouncycastle/jcajce/provider/package-tree.html\\norg/bouncycastle/jcajce/provider/package-summary.html\\norg/bouncycastle/jcajce/util/ProviderJcaJceHelper.html\\norg/bouncycastle/asn1/x509/UserNotice.html\\norg/bouncycastle/crypto/SecureRandomProvider.html\\norg/bouncycastle/crypto/fips/FipsEngineProvider.html\\norg/bouncycastle/crypto/util/BasicEntropySourceProvider.html\\norg/bouncycastle/crypto/asymmetric/ECDomainParametersIndex.html\\norg/bouncycastle/crypto/asymmetric/DHDomainParametersIndex.html\\norg/bouncycastle/crypto/EntropySourceProvider.html\\norg/bouncycastle/util/test/FixedEntropySourceProvider.html\\norg/bouncycastle/util/test/TestRandomEntropySourceProvider.html\\nindex.html\\nallclasses-index.html\\nmember-search-index.js\\nallpackages-index.html\\n<title>BouncyCastleFipsProvider (BC FIPS 2.1.2 API)</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"declaration: package: org.bouncycastle.jcajce.provider, class: BouncyCastleFipsProvider\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"sub-title\\\"><span class=\\\"package-label-in-type\\\">Package</span>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"package-summary.html\\\">org.bouncycastle.jcajce.provider</a></div>\\n<h1 title=\\\"Class BouncyCastleFipsProvider\\\" class=\\\"title\\\">Class BouncyCastleFipsProvider</h1>\\n<div class=\\\"inheritance\\\"><a href=\\\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/security/Provider.html\\\" title=\\\"class or interface in java.security\\\" class=\\\"external-link\\\">java.security.Provider</a>\\n<div class=\\\"inheritance\\\">org.bouncycastle.jcajce.provider.BouncyCastleFipsProvider</div>\\n<div class=\\\"type-signature\\\"><span class=\\\"modifiers\\\">public final class </span><span class=\\\"element-name type-name-label\\\">BouncyCastleFipsProvider</span>\\n<span class=\\\"extends-implements\\\">extends <a href=\\\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/security/Provider.html\\\" title=\\\"class or interface in java.security\\\" class=\\\"external-link\\\">Provider</a></span></div>\\n<div class=\\\"block\\\">The BC FIPS provider.\\n If no SecureRandom has been specified using CryptoServicesRegistrar.setSecureRandom() the provider class will generate a\\n FIPS compliant DRBG based on SHA-512. It is also possible to configure the DRBG by passing a string as a constructor\\n argument to the provider via code, or the java.security configuration file.\\n The default DRBG is configured to be prediction resistant. In situations where the amount of entropy is constrained\\n the default DRBG can be configured to use an entropy pool based on a SHA-512 SP 800-90A DRBG. To configure this use:\\n <b>Note</b>: if the provider is created by an \\\"approved mode\\\" thread, only FIPS approved algorithms will be available from it.\\n<li><a href=\\\"../../../../serialized-form.html#org.bouncycastle.jcajce.provider.BouncyCastleFipsProvider\\\">Serialized Form</a></li>\\n<h2 id=\\\"nested-classes-inherited-from-class-java.security.Provider\\\">Nested classes/interfaces inherited from class&nbsp;java.security.<a href=\\\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/security/Provider.html\\\" title=\\\"class or interface in java.security\\\" class=\\\"external-link\\\">Provider</a></h2>\\n<code><a href=\\\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/security/Provider.Service.html\\\" title=\\\"class or interface in java.security\\\" class=\\\"external-link\\\">Provider.Service</a></code></div>\\n<div class=\\\"col-second odd-row-color\\\"><code><a href=\\\"#PROVIDER_NAME\\\" class=\\\"member-name-link\\\">PROVIDER_NAME</a></code></div>\\n<div class=\\\"col-constructor-name even-row-color\\\"><code><a href=\\\"#%3Cinit%3E()\\\" class=\\\"member-name-link\\\">BouncyCastleFipsProvider</a>()</code></div>\\n<div class=\\\"block\\\">Base constructor - build a provider with the default configuration.</div>\\n<div class=\\\"col-constructor-name odd-row-co