age generation to consistently select the Java 9 multi-release implementation.\\\",\\n  \\\"risks\\\": [\\n    \\\"Forcing the java CPU variant validates the JCA provider and reachability metadata but does not cover BC-FIPS native AES/SHA acceleration.\\\",\\n    \\\"Successful execution in a native image does not by itself establish that the resulting deployment is within BC-FIPS's certified platform boundary.\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\", \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b9207a9aa79ef4f016a804366ffdc8191a59c42c271b565d6\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}], \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\", \"provider\": \"openai-codex\", \"model\": \"gpt-5.6-sol\", \"usage\": {\"input\": 21048, \"output\": 720, \"cacheRead\": 8704, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"reasoning\": 465, \"totalTokens\": 30472, \"cost\": {\"input\": 0, \"output\": 0, \"cacheRead\": 0, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"total\": 0}}, \"stopReason\": \"stop\", \"timestamp\": 1786790743515, \"responseId\": \"resp_0b9207a9aa79ef4f016a804357c58c8191bcfae830fbf70254\", \"rawStopReason\": \"completed\"}, \"toolResults\": []}\n[recv] agent_end\n[send] get_state\n[recv] {\"type\": \"agent_settled\"}\n[recv] get_state success\n  sessionFile: ../../../.pi/agent/sessions/--home-vjovanov-g-forge-graalvm-reachability-metadata-forge-local_repositories-forge_worktrees-5950-ae3e8922--/2026-08-15T10-44-57-346Z_01a00506-5982-7cdc-b119-7718b075facd.jsonl\n  sessionId: 01a00506-5982-7cdc-b119-7718b075facd\n[send] get_session_stats\n[recv] get_session_stats success\n  tokens: input=48825 output=1983 cacheRead=30208 cacheWrite=0 total=81016\n\n### human-intervention-logs/org.bouncycastle:bc-fips:2.1.2/improve-library-coverage/pi-generation-2026-08-15T10-30-09-542259Z.log tail\n  --- i/tests/src/org.bouncycastle/bc-fips/2.1.2/build.gradle\n  +++ w/tests/src/org.bouncycastle/bc-fips/2.1.2/build.gradle\n  @@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ dependencies {\n   \n   test {\n       jvmArgs(\"-Djdk.util.jar.version=9\")\n  +    jvmArgs(\"-Dorg.bouncycastle.