ime to force pure-Java mode. Also set -Djdk.util.jar.version=9 for JVM tests and pass -J-Djdk.util.jar.version=9 to native-image, matching the artifact's multi-release layout used by existing bc-fips coverage.\",\n4280:[assistant]   \"risks\": [\n4281:[assistant]     \"If native acceleration is not disabled, tests may depend on host CPU features, temp-directory native library extraction, and bundled native library loading rather than portable reachability metadata.\",\n4282:[assistant]     \"Approved-only FIPS mode is a separate usage mode; only set org.bouncycastle.fips.approved_only if the generated test intentionally covers approved-only behavior.\"\n4283:[assistant]   ]\n4284:[assistant] }\n4285:[assistant-event] text_end\n4288:[recv] agent_end\n4289:[send] get_state\n4290:[recv] {\"type\": \"agent_settled\"}\n4294:[send] get_session_stats\n4295:[recv] get_session_stats success\n### human-intervention-logs/org.bouncycastle:bc-fips:2.1.2/library-preparation-preflight/pi-generation-2026-08-15T10-46-04-829278Z.log\n6:[send] prompt\n79:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n82:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n205:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n208:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n747:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n752:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n1248:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n1249:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n2948:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n2955:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n2956:[assistant-event] text_start\n2957:[assistant] {\n2958:[assistant]   \"action\": \"advisory_preparation\",\n2959:[assistant]   \"summary\": \"The artifact is self-contained and needs no Docker service or additional Maven dependency, but its multi-release provider and bundled JNI acceleration require explicit Native Image configuration.\",\n2960:[assistant]   \"deterministic_setup\": [],\n2961:[assistant]   \"agent_guidance\": \"Register org.bouncycastle.jcajce.provider.BouncyCastleFipsProvider before requesting JCA services and configure Native Image with -H:AdditionalSecurityProviders=org.bouncycastle.jcajce.provider.BouncyCastleFipsProvider. Set -Dorg.bouncycastle.native.cpu_variant=java for native-image generation and native test runtime so BC-FIPS does not extract and load its bundled x86_64 JNI libraries. Use -Djdk.util.jar.version=9 for JVM tests and -J-Djdk.util.jar.version=9 during native-image generation to consistently select the Java 9 multi-release implementation.\",\n2962:[assistant]   \"risks\": [\n2963:[assistant]     \"Forcing the java CPU variant validates the JCA provider and reachability metadata but does not cover BC-FIPS native AES/SHA acceleration.\",\n2964:[assistant]     \"Successful execution in a native image does not by itself establish that the resulting deployment is within BC-FIPS's certified platform boundary.\"\n2965:[assistant]   ]\n2966:[assistant] }\n2967:[assistant-event] text_end\n2970:[recv] agent_end\n2971:[send] get_state\n2972:[recv] {\"type\": \"agent_settled\"}\n2976:[send] get_session_stats\n2977:[recv] get_session_stats success\n### human-intervention-logs/org.bouncycastle:bc-fips:2.1.2/improve-library-coverage/pi-generation-2026-08-15T10-30-09-542259Z.log\n6:[send] prompt\n89:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n92:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n390:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n391:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n852:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n855:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n868:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n871:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n1674:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n1677:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n1783:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n1786:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n1880:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n1885:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n1933:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n1940:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n1953:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n1956:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n1969:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n1972:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n2034:[assistant-event] thinking_start\n2037:[assistant-event] thinking_end\n